going to be so much better than

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:23.680
everybody else. Sign this Sign right

00:05:21.600 --> 00:05:25.000
here. Like let's go. Let's go."

00:05:23.680 --> 00:05:26.440
Um

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:27.000
if you can if you can add value to

